        "width": 760,
        "height": 150,
        "body": "The formulas people rebuild in every spreadsheet, as cards: a percent change, a growth rate, a word count, an ordinal, a number spelled out. Each is an ordinary formula card underneath, locked so its formula can't drift; type into its fields or wire values in.",
